00:01:47.641 --> 00:01:49.619
I'm getting used to this.

00:01:49.643 --> 00:01:51.354
I don't feel nauseated anymore...

00:01:51.378 --> 00:01:56.759
I don't even... feel scared or
sorry when I see people die...

00:01:56.783 --> 00:01:58.595
Huh? Did you just say something?

00:01:58.619 --> 00:01:59.829
What's the matter?

00:01:59.853 --> 00:02:01.397
Oh, nothing...

00:02:01.421 --> 00:02:05.702
This is Japan, right? And we're in
the middle of a residential area...

00:02:05.726 --> 00:02:08.771
So why do I feel like I'm in a war?

00:02:08.795 --> 00:02:11.808
What am I doing with this thing anyway?

00:02:11.832 --> 00:02:15.678
Alll know is that I better
make sure to hold on to it...

00:02:15.702 --> 00:02:18.262
Ifi don't, it's gonna be bad...

00:02:20.073 --> 00:02:24.010
"Kato, You Wait Here"

00:02:25.078 --> 00:02:27.223
What are we supposed to do?

00:02:27.247 --> 00:02:28.725
There's more of 'em, right?

00:02:28.749 --> 00:02:30.093
Yeah...

00:02:30.117 --> 00:02:32.629
Kei, where'd the old lady and the kid go?

00:02:32.653 --> 00:02:35.231
--Uh...
--They're gone.

00:02:35.255 --> 00:02:41.437
Crap... Those two are screwed
if they run into the other alien.

00:02:41.461 --> 00:02:43.573
Hey, snap out of it!

00:02:43.597 --> 00:02:47.010
Why the hell should we care about the old
bag and that annoying little shit anyway?

00:02:47.034 --> 00:02:50.613
Haruya! Kids are supposed to be like that!

00:02:50.637 --> 00:02:53.616
Why don't you shut the hell up?

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:56.419
How long are you gonna keep acting
like you're the goddamn leader?

00:02:56.443 --> 00:02:58.421
Kosuke and Kinji...

00:02:58.445 --> 00:03:00.623
They both got their heads blown off!

00:03:00.647 --> 00:03:03.726
And you couldn't do shit!

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:07.482
You couldn't even save them!
So who the hell do you think you are?

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:17.907
It's just like with the guns...
I guess even puking has a time-lag...

00:03:17.931 --> 00:03:20.176
Kurono! What are you saying?!

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:24.147
Well, you sure are walking
tall now, aren't you, Haruya?

00:03:24.171 --> 00:03:25.415
You're damn right!

00:03:25.439 --> 00:03:28.117
If you don't like it, why don't ya give
me my tooth back! How about that?

00:03:28.141 --> 00:03:29.752
You son of a bitch...

00:03:29.776 --> 00:03:33.623
Listen to me if you wanna be free from this!

00:03:33.647 --> 00:03:37.593
I'm going to go find the other Suzuki Alien!

00:03:37.617 --> 00:03:41.164
And I'll see if I can find the old
lady and the boy while I'm at it.

00:03:41.188 --> 00:03:45.034
If you really want to survive,
then please help me out!

00:03:45.058 --> 00:03:48.871
You said something earlier
about getting free from this...

00:03:48.895 --> 00:03:50.873
Something about a score or whatever, right?

00:03:50.897 --> 00:03:55.011
I don't even know if it's true or not,
but we'll never find out unless we try.

00:03:55.035 --> 00:03:56.846
At this point, it's the only choice we have!

00:03:56.870 --> 00:04:01.351
To be honest with you, I don't
feel like trusting you with my life.

00:04:01.375 --> 00:04:05.722
But that biker guy... He got his head
blown away for no reason, right?

00:04:05.746 --> 00:04:07.523
Where did it happen?

00:04:07.547 --> 00:04:10.293
If you head straight down this way,
there's a payphone right around the corner.

00:04:10.317 --> 00:04:11.861
Right in front of the phone booth.

00:04:11.885 --> 00:04:13.410
The bastards...

00:04:14.421 --> 00:04:17.834
Sounds like you'll die if you go out of this area.

00:04:17.858 --> 00:04:19.736
It's about 1 square kilometer...

00:04:19.760 --> 00:04:26.175
Do you think there's like a bomb or
something planted in each of our heads?

00:04:26.199 --> 00:04:28.778
Who's keeping us in this
area and for what reason?

00:04:28.802 --> 00:04:30.947
This shit doesn't make any sense!

00:04:30.971 --> 00:04:33.950
I don't know who's doing this to us, either.

00:04:33.974 --> 00:04:36.152
The time limit is one hour...

00:04:36.176 --> 00:04:39.789
And we have to find two of those monsters
within a one-square kilometer block?

00:04:39.813 --> 00:04:41.491
Well, we did it last time.

00:04:41.515 --> 00:04:44.527
But that doesn't mean
we can do that every time.

00:04:44.551 --> 00:04:49.665
So that means he'd survived
many rounds up to now.

00:04:49.689 --> 00:04:51.100
A little brat like him?

00:04:51.124 --> 00:04:54.370
He killed Kosuke, remember?

00:04:54.394 --> 00:04:57.306
Listen, the fact is, we have
to find that other alien!

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:59.675
If you don't believe that,
you can do whatever you want.

00:04:59.699 --> 00:05:01.544
Kei, you aren't wearing a suit.

00:05:01.568 --> 00:05:03.900
So this time, I want you to stay somewhere safe.

00:05:09.042 --> 00:05:10.219
Hey, what happened?

00:05:10.243 --> 00:05:13.656
Just a minute ago, you were looking at me like
you thought I was actually cool or something.

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:15.375
What's your problem?

00:05:19.319 --> 00:05:22.565
For the meantime,
you walk the way I tell you to.

00:05:22.589 --> 00:05:25.320
--Huh?!
--You heard me!

00:05:27.828 --> 00:05:28.938
Hey, Haruya!

00:05:28.962 --> 00:05:32.909
You, too, asshole! Frickin' has-been "leader"!

00:05:32.933 --> 00:05:34.610
Give me that thing.

00:05:34.634 --> 00:05:36.500
Damn, that hurt...

00:05:38.305 --> 00:05:39.816
Hurry up and hand it over!

00:05:39.840 --> 00:05:42.852
Haruya, you son of a...

00:05:42.876 --> 00:05:44.287
Hey, you!

00:05:44.311 --> 00:05:47.804
You ain't sneaking off on me!
Get back over here!

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:52.495
--Where...?
--"Where"?

00:05:52.519 --> 00:05:54.931
Who do you mean?
The old lady, or the Suzuki Alien?

00:05:54.955 --> 00:05:56.532
Both.

00:05:56.556 --> 00:05:58.968
Why don't we ask this taxi for help?

00:05:58.992 --> 00:06:00.536
It won't work.

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:04.155
It looks like we're invisible to
everyone else until this thing is over.

00:06:05.532 --> 00:06:08.558
So does this mean we really are dead?

00:06:15.742 --> 00:06:18.688
| wonder where we are...

00:06:18.712 --> 00:06:22.945
I'm hungry! I can't walk anymore!

00:06:24.784 --> 00:06:27.082
Oh, dear...

00:06:28.788 --> 00:06:32.001
Who the fuck told you to stop?

00:06:32.025 --> 00:06:33.936
Ow...

00:06:33.960 --> 00:06:37.840
Are you crying? Pathetic!

00:06:37.864 --> 00:06:39.342
Son of a bitch...

00:06:39.366 --> 00:06:42.631
Now walk! C'mon, hurry up!

00:06:46.239 --> 00:06:48.367
Hey, Kato...

00:06:49.976 --> 00:06:53.289
You're not going to use guns?

00:06:53.313 --> 00:06:56.613
It might be better if you do, though...

00:06:57.651 --> 00:06:58.861
I mean...

00:06:58.885 --> 00:07:02.398
I think you're trying really hard.

00:07:02.422 --> 00:07:04.200
But... Well...

00:07:04.224 --> 00:07:06.435
If you'd pulled the trigger a little sooner,

00:07:06.459 --> 00:07:10.239
that kid might have been all right.

00:07:10.263 --> 00:07:15.211
That's not what I was trying to say!

00:07:15.235 --> 00:07:19.582
Women usually have
stronger survival instincts...

00:07:19.606 --> 00:07:21.651
Well, I don't think that's true!

00:07:21.675 --> 00:07:24.287
No. You... You're right.

00:07:24.311 --> 00:07:25.521
Kato...

00:07:25.545 --> 00:07:28.105
