00:07:29.783 --> 00:07:32.328
It's close... It should be nearby.

00:07:32.352 --> 00:07:35.665
But which is it? The Suzuki Alien
or the old lady and the kid?

00:07:35.689 --> 00:07:37.667
I can't tell.

00:07:37.691 --> 00:07:41.025
No, we don't know... but we will in a minute!

00:07:46.533 --> 00:07:49.679
Hurry the fuck up! You still
haven't figured it out?!

00:07:49.703 --> 00:07:53.249
This is not mine, so it looks
like it works differently.

00:07:53.273 --> 00:07:55.451
What, so if it were yours
you'd know how to use it?

00:07:55.475 --> 00:07:56.953
Well, not exactly...

00:07:56.977 --> 00:07:58.387
Stop mumbling!

00:07:58.411 --> 00:08:00.990
Where's the other one of those monsters?

00:08:01.014 --> 00:08:04.560
This thing is only showing the
streets right along the river!

00:08:04.584 --> 00:08:07.212
How do I get it to show me the other areas?

00:08:08.221 --> 00:08:09.465
There's more now!

00:08:09.489 --> 00:08:11.981
So there isn't just one?

00:08:20.967 --> 00:08:24.747
Maybe that screen's
showing people as dots, too?

00:08:24.771 --> 00:08:26.616
This is so confusing...

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:29.885
But, if that's the case, it should
show Kei and the others, too.

00:08:29.909 --> 00:08:32.088
Can you see the river?

00:08:32.112 --> 00:08:36.092
Either way, I don't think he'd
be walking around on his own.

00:08:36.116 --> 00:08:39.108
So that must mean this dot is...

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:41.645
Here it comes...

00:08:56.403 --> 00:08:58.447
That scary thing is back...

00:08:58.471 --> 00:09:01.651
Don't you worry, Ryota, those guys will...

00:09:01.675 --> 00:09:03.919
Get out of here! Now!

00:09:03.943 --> 00:09:05.221
Go now!

00:09:05.245 --> 00:09:08.237
