00:09:28.968 --> 00:09:30.446
We'll get them with our bare hands!

00:09:30.470 --> 00:09:32.515
What? Are you crazy?

00:09:32.539 --> 00:09:34.550
With guns, if you miss them, you're out of luck.

00:09:34.574 --> 00:09:36.419
We'll use something more reliable instead!

00:09:36.443 --> 00:09:38.377
You have a point, but still...

00:09:40.547 --> 00:09:42.037
What's wrong?

00:09:46.419 --> 00:09:48.497
How many of them are there?

00:09:48.521 --> 00:09:50.990
Yuzo.

00:10:10.143 --> 00:10:11.941
Kato!

00:10:14.514 --> 00:10:17.381
This is how you catch them! Pay attention!

00:10:33.767 --> 00:10:35.144
There's more?

00:10:35.168 --> 00:10:38.035
This is... This is...

00:11:07.367 --> 00:11:09.335
Kato!

00:11:19.345 --> 00:11:20.823
Kishimoto...

00:11:20.847 --> 00:11:23.292
He can't shoot it.

00:11:23.316 --> 00:11:26.251
But... We don't have time for that!

00:11:40.834 --> 00:11:44.780
Hey, do you think that scary
robot will be back again?

00:11:44.804 --> 00:11:47.383
We'll be fine.

00:11:47.407 --> 00:11:50.274
I'm sure we'll be okay if we
can find somewhere to hide.

00:11:51.344 --> 00:11:53.789
You just bring me that frickin'
Suzuki Alien or whatever.

00:11:53.813 --> 00:11:58.327
I'll tear that piece of shit apart!

00:11:58.351 --> 00:12:00.649
Hey, you found it yet? Well?

00:12:01.688 --> 00:12:03.032
There it is...

00:12:03.056 --> 00:12:05.468
--But...
--But what?

00:12:05.492 --> 00:12:09.038
I don't know why, but... it's huge.

00:12:09.062 --> 00:12:11.087
It doesn't matter!

00:12:15.268 --> 00:12:16.378
It's in there.

00:12:16.402 --> 00:12:18.080
All right. Get movin'

00:12:18.104 --> 00:12:19.648
What, me first?

00:12:19.672 --> 00:12:21.766
Of course, ya frickin' moron!

00:12:24.277 --> 00:12:25.421
Shit!

00:12:25.445 --> 00:12:26.455
{ could kill him now,

00:12:26.479 --> 00:12:29.758
but there's no point unless we
kill the rest of the Suzuki aliens...

00:12:29.782 --> 00:12:31.443
Damn it!

00:13:17.330 --> 00:13:19.059
My suit...

00:13:23.736 --> 00:13:25.314
Now his suit's ruined, too.

00:13:25.338 --> 00:13:26.931
Kato!

00:13:58.338 --> 00:14:01.308
If you can't shoot them, then I will...

00:14:02.842 --> 00:14:05.120
Stay back, Kato!

00:14:05.144 --> 00:14:07.222
