00:14:07.246 --> 00:14:09.224
I won't let you kill him!

00:14:09.248 --> 00:14:12.895
This is for him! For Kato!

00:14:12.919 --> 00:14:15.030
That's enough! Just run!

00:14:15.054 --> 00:14:16.765
Kato, get out of here!

00:14:16.789 --> 00:14:18.951
Get out of here, quick!

00:14:23.429 --> 00:14:25.625
Like this, right?

00:14:58.531 --> 00:15:00.142
Is this it?

00:15:00.166 --> 00:15:01.076
I think so...

00:15:01.100 --> 00:15:01.910
"Try our delicious wings!"
I think so...

00:15:01.934 --> 00:15:04.062
"Try our delicious wings!"

00:15:04.470 --> 00:15:07.116
Yeah, this is it, all right.

00:15:07.140 --> 00:15:08.651
There...

00:15:08.675 --> 00:15:14.390
There's... so many of them in there.

00:15:14.414 --> 00:15:16.859
Hey, getin there.

00:15:16.883 --> 00:15:19.895
I thought you were gonna tear 'em apart.

00:15:19.919 --> 00:15:21.530
Shut up!

00:15:21.554 --> 00:15:23.318
Now get in there.

00:15:24.857 --> 00:15:27.053
I'll frickin' blow your head off!

00:15:32.298 --> 00:15:35.825
| gotta pee! I gotta pee!

00:15:37.804 --> 00:15:40.182
Can't you hold it in?

00:15:40.206 --> 00:15:43.519
I gotta pee! Mommy!

00:15:43.543 --> 00:15:46.274
Then just do it here.

00:15:55.388 --> 00:15:56.913
Hey!

00:16:05.698 --> 00:16:07.009
What do we do?

00:16:07.033 --> 00:16:08.728
Just wait...

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:16.441
What the hell is wrong with this thing?

00:16:28.354 --> 00:16:29.998
Where's the old lady and the kid?

00:16:30.022 --> 00:16:32.234
I think they ran ahead of us.

00:16:32.258 --> 00:16:36.320
Crap... The other aliens
might have gone after them!

00:16:37.864 --> 00:16:39.389
Let's go!

00:16:51.177 --> 00:16:53.355
Grandma! Grandma!

00:16:53.379 --> 00:16:53.789
"Try our delicious wings!"
Grandma! Grandma!

00:16:53.813 --> 00:16:54.746
"Try our delicious wings!"

00:17:08.327 --> 00:17:10.973
Shit... I'm not wearing a suit.

00:17:10.997 --> 00:17:13.208
What am I supposed to do if they attack me?

00:17:13.232 --> 00:17:15.257
<i>What the hell am I gonna do?</i>

00:17:20.773 --> 00:17:22.217
Listen to me, Ryota.

00:17:22.241 --> 00:17:26.522
I'm going to stay here.
You go on and run out the back.

00:17:26.546 --> 00:17:28.514
What about you?

00:17:29.749 --> 00:17:32.594
Grandma will take care of them.

00:17:32.618 --> 00:17:34.530
No! This is embarrassing!

00:17:34.554 --> 00:17:36.545
Go on now. Run!

00:17:48.768 --> 00:17:50.497
Grandma...

00:17:53.206 --> 00:17:56.418
Officer! Help!

00:17:56.442 --> 00:17:58.638
My grandma, she's...

00:18:09.522 --> 00:18:11.466
Grandma!

00:18:11.490 --> 00:18:15.358
Grandma! Grandma!

00:18:26.505 --> 00:18:28.940
Grand...

00:18:32.979 --> 00:18:36.882
Don't worry, Ryota...

00:18:55.067 --> 00:18:56.345
There's nothing here.

00:18:56.369 --> 00:18:58.814
You dumb-ass, you forgot about upstairs!

00:18:58.838 --> 00:19:00.215
Go check up there!

00:19:00.239 --> 00:19:02.150
I said there's nothing here!

00:19:02.174 --> 00:19:05.153
You're the one who told me
there's a bunch of them!

00:19:05.177 --> 00:19:06.488
Go!

00:19:06.512 --> 00:19:08.537
I'll shoot you if you don't!

00:19:14.320 --> 00:19:18.233
It's possible that the machine
could've been broken, right?

00:19:18.257 --> 00:19:21.420
I already told him there's
nothing here, that fat fuck!

00:19:53.092 --> 00:19:56.756
--Yuzo?
--Yuzo?

00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:15.448
Yuzo.

00:20:16.449 --> 00:20:18.213
Yuzo.

00:21:06.799 --> 00:21:13.933
Hajimari wa dare demo junshin muku na baby

00:21:18.411 --> 00:21:25.442
Nigai mi kajitte mo
kujikecha dame yo walk straight

00:21:29.989 --> 00:21:37.989
Satta koto da kedo
ame no naka zukizuki itamu yo

00:21:44.103 --> 00:21:46.348
I'm lonely as floating ice

00:21:46.372 --> 00:21:51.186
Yaseta yubi ni kiss o shite

00:21:51.210 --> 00:21:57.893
Naita anata o omoidasu yo

00:21:57.917 --> 00:22:02.764
Kore de owari da to shite mo

00:22:02.788 --> 00:22:07.669
Saigo no kiss wa wasurenai yo

00:22:07.693 --> 00:22:15.693
Wasurenai yo... Wasurenai yo...

00:22:19.605 --> 00:22:27.605
Kare no kiss o wasurenai yo

00:22:37.022 --> 00:22:38.767
What is that bird?

00:22:38.791 --> 00:22:40.302
The guy was taken away.

00:22:40.326 --> 00:22:42.971
Huh? Something got shot.

00:22:42.995 --> 00:22:45.707
It's falling. Stupid...

00:22:45.731 --> 00:22:46.575
Next time: "Pleazo Die."

00:22:46.599 --> 00:22:47.976
"L21ris the snd? Eh?"
